cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you refer to this work, please cite this repository and the original Steam dataset paper."
title: "Steam Recommendation and Bundle Optimization"
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Pillai
    given-names: Pranav
    affiliation: "National University of Singapore"
repository-code: "https://github.com/pranavpillaiNUS/steam-recommendation-and-bundle-optimization"
version: "s1-v2-20260814"
abstract: >-
  Undergraduate research project (UROP) supervised by Dr Li Xiaobo at the National University of
  Singapore, covering implicit-feedback preference estimation and scenario-based fixed-bundle
  optimization on a historical Steam snapshot. Stage 1 is complete and Stage 2 is planned. This is
  research code kept for the project record, not a released library.
keywords:
  - recommender systems
  - implicit feedback
  - matrix factorization
  - bundling
  - operations research
